{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/8385e0905fc7329cb0c8f0576ae091a5.avif?t=1756630588\" width=616 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRAWLER is a <strong>Co-op VR Horde Shooter</strong> where you and a friend are intergalactic exterminators, hired to clear an alien infestation on a crimson, rocky planet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot your six-legged Mech through <strong>randomly generated missions</strong>, as you complete distinct objectives for your employer and exterminate hordes of bugs. With your earnings, return to home-base and <strong>purchase new upgrades</strong> for your mech.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a global deadline that decreases whenever your in a mission, you must act quickly if your to meet the ever growing\u00a0<strong>Company Quota</strong>. As it rises,\u00a0<strong>expect new environments and threats</strong> to make themselves known. Die, then run it all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Crush, Exterminate,\u00a0Upgrade, Repeat!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/b56c247329456c2d8581f43ebb3ea43c.webp?t=1756630588\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/e5ca00c38155ef6cef23e1ce9579d081.poster.avif?t=1756630588\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/e5ca00c38155ef6cef23e1ce9579d081.webm?t=1756630588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/e5ca00c38155ef6cef23e1ce9579d081.mp4?t=1756630588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast them to pieces,\u00a0Crush them underfoot!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a <strong>six-legged Mech</strong> built for extermination as you face off against endless hordes of alien vermin that spit, swarm\u00a0and explode in a\u00a0satisfying squelch. Combat in\u00a0<i>CRAWLER</i>\u00a0is intense, overwhelming, and <strong>engrossingly satisfying.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/241d125dad3b351601ca4cb9ab0ce441.webp?t=1756630588\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/bf14086bad40e04083dcd036b0cefb83.poster.avif?t=1756630588\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/bf14086bad40e04083dcd036b0cefb83.webm?t=1756630588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/bf14086bad40e04083dcd036b0cefb83.mp4?t=1756630588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the quota! (or buy upgrades)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following each mission, return to base. Here you can <strong>select new missions</strong>, submit your quota and <strong>purchase new upgrades</strong> for your mech, from quick-firing mini-guns, to head tracked defense weaponry.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/3bda375df268fa2bc5d3ac1f311c9839.webp?t=1756630588\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/56c978cdc2df5021979e7a4ef4c178b2.poster.avif?t=1756630588\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/56c978cdc2df5021979e7a4ef4c178b2.webm?t=1756630588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/56c978cdc2df5021979e7a4ef4c178b2.mp4?t=1756630588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...But most importantly, exterminate with friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CRAWLER\u00a0</i>is designed around chaotic co-op action with\u00a0<strong>two players</strong>. One brawls as the driver, while the other strikes from the turret. <strong>Communication</strong> and <strong>teamwork</strong> are mandatory for optimal bug extermination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/c557b5cf91c20749733459545c553ab5.avif?t=1756630588\" width=617 height=301 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3859880?t=1756630588","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/74f9d143eebdeebcc311eb367d4272c2ba47d817/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756630588","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/7c2f410e7baf176c54a01a925fc22a12586c3a21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756630588","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/7c2f410e7baf176c54a01a925fc22a12586c3a21/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756630588","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Features stylized bug gore, LOTS of green blood, and the occasional middle finger"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/8385e0905fc7329cb0c8f0576ae091a5.avif?t=1756630588\" width=616 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRAWLER is a <strong>Co-op VR Horde Shooter</strong> where you and a friend are intergalactic exterminators, hired to clear an alien infestation on a crimson, rocky planet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot your six-legged Mech through <strong>randomly generated missions</strong>, as you complete distinct objectives for your employer and exterminate hordes of bugs. With your earnings, return to home-base and <strong>purchase new upgrades</strong> for your mech.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a global deadline that decreases whenever your in a mission, you must act quickly if your to meet the ever growing\u00a0<strong>Company Quota</strong>. As it rises,\u00a0<strong>expect new environments and threats</strong> to make themselves known. Die, then run it all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Crush, Exterminate,\u00a0Upgrade, Repeat!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset